      "source": "OMG SysML v2.0 Language Specification",
      "url": "https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/2.0/Language/PDF",
      "scope": "Requirements、Calculations、Constraints、Analysis Cases、Verification Cases 与 Views 的语言语义。"
